```powershell
$TAG = "2026-10-22-001"
```

Tag the image:

```powershell
docker tag shiftweave:initial `
  "$ACCOUNT_ID.dkr.ecr.$env:AWS_REGION.amazonaws.com/shiftweave:$TAG"
