Create an EC2 instance role with only the permissions required by the application.

The role may need:

```text
AmazonSSMManagedInstanceCore
ECR image pull permissions
Secrets Manager read permission for selected secrets
S3 write permission for the backup bucket
Bedrock invoke permission only if Bedrock is enabled
CloudWatch log permissions if logs are shipped there
```

Do not attach:

```text
AdministratorAccess
PowerUserAccess
```

to the EC2 instance role.

Limit resource permissions to:

- One ECR repository
- One Secrets Manager secret or secret path
- One S3 backup bucket
- Only the selected Bedrock model or inference profile
- One CloudWatch log group

Also restrict `iam:PassRole` permissions for the human deployment identity. Do not use an unrestricted `iam:PassRole` on all roles.

