## 16. Do not use EFS or S3 for the live SQLite database

Use:

```text
SQLite -> local Linux filesystem -> EBS
```

Do not use:

```text
SQLite -> EFS
SQLite -> NFS
SQLite -> S3
SQLite -> multiple EC2 hosts
```

The application uses SQLite WAL and local locking. EBS is attached to one EC2 instance and is suitable for this one-writer deployment.

S3 is only for backup copies.

