## 32. Configure SQLite backups

Before updates or schema changes, create a SQLite-consistent backup:

```bash
docker compose exec app \
  node build/scripts/backup.js \
  /app/backups/before-update.db
```

List backups:

```bash
ls -lah /mnt/shiftweave/backups
```

Copy backups to a private S3 bucket.

The backup bucket should use:

- Block Public Access
- Server-side encryption
- Versioning
- Restricted IAM policy
- Lifecycle retention
- Optional object lock if required by compliance

Do not copy only the main database file while the application is actively using WAL.

Use the application backup process instead.

