## 33. Configure EBS snapshots

Create regular snapshots of the data EBS volume.

Use a retention policy that matches your recovery requirements.

EBS snapshots protect against:

- EC2 host failure
- Volume corruption
- Accidental deletion
- Recovery to a replacement instance

EBS snapshots do not replace application-consistent SQLite backups. Use both:

```text
SQLite backup -> S3
EBS snapshot -> volume recovery
```

EBS is Availability-Zone scoped. Restoring to another Availability Zone requires restoring or copying from the snapshot.

